''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|Archers specialize in long-distance attacks using a bow and arrow, so you can strike before your target even knows it's in your sight! You can attack a single creature or use explosive arrows to attack multiple enemies at the same time. Archers are trained by [[Lugabow]], the defender of the [[Greenwood Forest]].|Job description}}</font>''
'''Archer''' is a combat class [[Jobs|job]]. It specializes in long-distance combat using bows. This experience is gained by completing Archer [[Quests|quests]] and by battling in combat instances in the [[Wilds]] and in [[Dungeons|dungeons]].

==Unlocking Archer==
As of March 16th, 2013, the Archer job is no longer a [[:Category:Members Only|Members Only]] job, however you will first need to unlock the job before using it. To unlock the Archer job, you must speak to [[Lugabow]] in the [[Greenwood Camp]], located north of the [[Bandit Hideout!|Bandit Hideout]], west of [[Lavender Coast Pass]] [[Warpstones|warpstone]].

==Trainers==
*Lugabow in Greenwood Camp (starts questline)
*Hilforn in the northern part of Greenwood Forest

